&lt;div class="_9d763823 _721d4f0a ca9510cb d71b598c _7c466880 _0d2d5ee0 _67866338 _3b42afd3"&gt; &lt;h2 class="e6590096 _5a134e6a dcac4cd6 _3ff84621 _0b90939f _4434babe _1ccd852b _2b366c9a fee11784 _381c41ae _91345936"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;SQL Developer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: 4+yrs&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Location: Chennai&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;We are looking for skilled SQL developer with strong expertise in Microsoft SQL server, ETL development, and SSIS. The ideal candidate will be responsible for developing, optimizing, and maintaining SQL databases, ETL processes, and data integration.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key

RESPONSIBILITIES:
&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Design, develop, and optimize complex SQL queries, stored procedures, views, functions, and triggers.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Develop, maintain and troubleshoot ETL processes using SQL Server Integrated Services (SSIS).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Monitor, Support and enhance existing ETL jobs and scheduled data integration workflows.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Optimize database performance through query tuning, indexing, and execution plan analysis.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong experience in SQL server (2017/2022/2025)&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Advanced knowledge of SQL programming, including: &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt;Stored procedure&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Functions&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Views&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Triggers&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;CTEs&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Dynamic SQL&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Temporary Tables&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of database design, normalization, and relational database concepts.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with SQL Server Integration Services (SSIS&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;div class="_9d763823 _721d4f0a ca9510cb d71b598c _7c466880 _0d2d5ee0 _67866338 _3b42afd3"&gt; &lt;h2 class="e6590096 _5a134e6a dcac4cd6 _3ff84621 _0b90939f _4434babe _1ccd852b _2b366c9a fee11784 _381c41ae _91345936"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the job&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;/div&gt; &lt;p class="e6590096 d2e620b9 _3ff84621 _0b90939f _52b33e66 _3636d943 _2b366c9a fee11784 _381c41ae _91345936 _1e184552"&gt;&lt;span class="b532df19 _0f41423d _3b42afd3" data-testid="expandable-text-box"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Career Area&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Technology, Digital and Data&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Work Shapes the World at Caterpillar Inc.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;When you join Caterpillar, you’re joining a global team who cares not just about the work we do – but also about each other. We are the makers, problem solvers, and future world builders who are creating stronger, more sustainable communities. We don’t just talk about progress and innovation here – we make it happen, with our customers, where we work and live. Together, we are building a better world, so we can all enjoy living in it.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Summary&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Responsible for administering, maintaining, and optimizing Snowflake cloud data platform environments. Works alongside senior DBAs and data engineers to ensure availability, security, and performance of Snowflake databases across development, QA, and production tires.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul class="_893dbef1 _3b0fffcd _3b42afd3"&gt; &lt;li&gt;Monitor and maintain Snowflake databases, schemas, warehouses, and account-level objects across multiple environments (DEV, QA, PROD).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage role-based access control (RBAC): create/alter roles, grant database roles, and troubleshoot privilege issues.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Perform object migrations between environments — DDL deployments, grants replication, and semantic view promotions.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Investigate and resolve query performance issues using Query Profile, ACCOUNT_USAGE views, and warehouse metrics.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Manage Snowflake tasks, streams, dynamic tables, and scheduled pipelines.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Assist with Streamlit app deployments, Cortex AI feature enablement (semantic views, Cortex Analyst), and Native App support.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Implement and maintain network policies, MFA enforcement, and key rotation procedures.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Write and maintain migration scripts (GRANT statements, DDL changes, environment parity checks).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Participate in on-call rotation for production incident response.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class="e6590096 d2e620b9 _3ff84621 _0b90939f _52b33e66 _3636d943 _2b366c9a fee11784 _381c41ae _91345936 _1e184552"&gt;&lt;span class="b532df19 _0f41423d _3b42afd3" data-testid="expandable-text-box"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Have&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required

QUALIFICATIONS:
&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul class="_893dbef1 _3b0fffcd _3b42afd3"&gt; &lt;li&gt;4+ years experience with Snowflake Data Warehouse.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Working knowledge of SQL including stored procedures, UDFs, and DDL management.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Snowflake RBAC model (account roles, database roles, ownership, future grants).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Understanding of warehouse configuration, credit consumption, and cost management basics.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one scripting language (Python, Bash, Power Shell) for automation.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Basic understanding of CI/CD pipelines and version-controlled database migrations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class="e6590096 d2e620b9 _3ff84621 _0b90939f _52b33e66 _3636d943 _2b366c9a fee11784 _381c41ae _91345936 _1e184552"&gt;&lt;span class="b532df19 _0f41423d _3b42afd3" data-testid="expandable-text-box"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred Qualifications&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul class="_893dbef1 _3b0fffcd _3b42afd3"&gt; &lt;li&gt;Snow Pro Core certification.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience with Snowflake features: dynamic tables, tasks, Snowpark.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Cortex AI services (semantic views, Cortex Analyst, Cortex Search).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Experience supporting Streamlit-in-Snowflake or Native App deployments.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Knowledge of data governance concepts (masking policies, row access policies, tagging).&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Good to have knowledge on Qlik Replicate&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class="e6590096 d2e620b9 _3ff84621 _0b90939f _52b33e66 _3636d943 _2b366c9a fee11784 _381c41ae _91345936 _1e184552"&gt;&lt;span class="b532df19 _0f41423d _3b42afd3" data-testid="expandable-text-box"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills&lt;br /&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt; &lt;ul class="_893dbef1 _3b0fffcd _3b42afd3"&gt; &lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail when managing cross-environment grants and migrations.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Clear written communication for runbooks, incident postmortems, and change requests.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Ability to work across time zones with distributed engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt;Willingness to learn and adapt to rapid platform feature releases.&lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;p class="e6590096 d2e620b9 _3ff84621 _0b90939f _52b33e66 _3636d943 _2b366c9a fee11784 _381c41ae _91345936 _1e184552"&gt;&lt;span class="b532df19 _0f41423d _3b42afd3" data-testid="expandable-text-box"&gt;Caterpillar is not currently hiring individuals for this position who now or in the future require sponsorship for employment visa status; however, as a global company, Caterpillar offers many job opportunities outside of India which can be found through our employment website at &lt;a class="fee11784 _20dea5d9 _50ed7e79 e97bf3c7 _6398628b" href="https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fwww%2Ecaterpillar%2Ecom%2Fcareers&amp;urlhash=3d Fv&amp;mt=t Xly HGc KCg4xum J45rqhyu D6OBWJx6X-w A82u O-l R7Fk Vwk17n APj N-3PMd FIp7O9-Kck Wix QKwdm Ly Rwybez-VL3HU&amp;is Sdui=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;www.caterpillar.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Get&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Our goal at Caterpillar is for you to have a rewarding career. Our teams are critical to the success of our customers who build a better world. Here you earn more than just wage, because we value your performance, we offer a total rewards package that provides day one benefits along with the potential of a variable bonus. Additional benefits include paid annual leave, flexi leave, medical and insurance (prorated based upon hire date).&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Final Details&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Please frequently check the email associated with your application, including the junk/spam folder, as this is the primary correspondence method. If you wish to know the status of your application – please use the candidate log-in on our career website as it will reflect any updates to your status.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;If you are interested in joining our team, please apply using an English version of your CV. We look forward to meeting you!&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This Job Description is intended as a general guide to the job duties for this position and is intended for the purpose of establishing the specific salary grade. It is not designed to contain or be interpreted as an exhaustive summary of all responsibilities, duties and effort required of employees assigned to this job. At the discretion of management, this description may be changed at any time to address the evolving needs of the organization.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Caterpillar&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Caterpillar Inc. is the world’s leading manufacturer of construction and mining equipment, off-highway diesel and natural gas engines, industrial gas turbines and diesel-electric locomotives. For nearly 100 years, we’ve been helping customers build a better, more sustainable world and are committed and contributing to a reduced-carbon future. Our innovative products and services, backed by our global dealer network, provide exceptional value that helps customers succeed.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;This position requires working onsite five days a week.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Visa Sponsorship is not available for this position.&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Posting Dates&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;July 6, 2026 – July 20, 2026&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Caterpillar is an Equal Opportunity Employer. Qualified applicants of any age are encouraged to apply&lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt;Not ready to apply? Join our &lt;a class="fee11784 _20dea5d9 _50ed7e79 e97bf3c7 _6398628b" href="https://www.linkedin.com/safety/go/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fflows%2Ebeamery%2Ecom%2Fcaterpillarinc%2Ftalcom&amp;urlhash=zr1s&amp;mt=sl Ylx Xu4jm KIh J5A1z8g INPe40Z2fukbfl CWERBCf L7SU7P83r We Ae OQx Pa8Czt4i DI5CUb ZE-c4OIku Mfc UGra Iz98&amp;is Sdui=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Talent Community&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
